#+title: Emacs and home configuration

* Reasoning

The goal is to colocate configuation of Emacs as well as other user-facing packages on my personal machine
within this file. Over the last few years I've used the wonderful ~chezmoi~ package to achieve this without facing many issues,
however for now I've decided to switch to just using Org's ~tangle~ functionality which, while less complex, provides most of
the features I care about and synchronizes better with my personal workflow.

The basis for the configuration is the excellent [[https://github.com/jamescherti/minimal-emacs.d?tab=readme-ov-file#features][minimal-emacs]] configuration.

